nostic-plan-immediately-while-concurrently-funding-onboarding-redesign-and-support-quality-investment-holding-pricing-and-competitive-program-spend-pending-diagnostic-confirmation)608 0 R(dead-end-assigning-point-probability-weights-to-each-of-the-six-categories)613 0 R(dead-end-computing-an-absolute-dollar-revenue-at-risk-figure)611 0 R(dead-end-ranking-the-six-categories-by-industry-base-rates-for-saas-churn-causes)612 0 R(dead-end-treating-one-single-dominant-factor-as-a-required-finding)610 0 R(executive-summary)588 0 R(root-cause-analysis-of-rising-northbrook-churn)587 0 R]>>>>>>
